Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, python3-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, x11-utils
Recommends: gir1.2-gtk4layershell-1.0, power-profiles-daemon, nvidia-prime
Homepage: https://blazorplate.net
Description: Tray flyout to toggle Intel CPU turbo and cool the laptop
 Problem: Ubuntu laptops with Intel turbo, a discrete NVIDIA GPU, and
 background container VMs run hot even when barely used. Boost, the
 Performance profile, Docker Desktop, and NVIDIA drawing the screen dump
 heat into the chassis, and the fixes are scattered.
 .
 Solution: CPU Turbo puts those heat switches in one tray flyout, with CPU
 and palm-rest temperatures and a live report.
 Built by BinaryPlates (Mohammad Mustafa). https://blazorplate.net
